          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika wa MUKAMA akagambira Filipo ati: “Imuka ogende, okwate omuhanda ogw'obukiizi bw'obulyo, ogw'irungu, ogurukuruga Yerusaalemu nigugenda Gaaza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaimuka, yagenda. Omusaija wa Esiyopiya omukonwa, omuheereza wa Kandaake Omukamakati wa Esiyopiya, ow'akaba ali mukeeto w'ebintu bye byona, akaba aizire Yerusaalemu kuramya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kasumi ako akaba naagaruka owaabu, aikaliire omu kigaali kye, kandi naasoma Ekitabu kya Isaaya omurangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwoyo wa Ruhanga yagambira Filipo ati: “Irirra ekigaali eki, ogende nakyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Filipo yairuka, yamuhikaho, yamuhurra naasoma Ekitabu kya Isaaya omurangi, nukwo kumukaguza ati: “Ebi orukusoma ebi, noobyetegereza?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oli yamugarukamu ati: “Ndabyetegereza nta, hataroho ansoboroliire?” Yasaba Filipo atembe omu kigaali kye, aikarre nawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.53.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 53:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.53.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekicweka eky'omu Byahandiikirwe eki akaba naasoma nkinu:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
